\cdot [\\begin{aligned}4a \\\\ 3a \\\\ -2a\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}k(4a) \\\\ k(3a) \\\\ k(-2a)\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}4(ka) \\\\ 3(ka) \\\\ -2(ka)\\end{aligned}],\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich satisfies the conditions $\\frac{x}{4}=\\frac{y}{3}=-\\frac{z}{2}.$ Therefore, $k\\cdot a\\in L.$\n\n- Statement IV is true. Since statements II and III are true, $L$ is a subspace of ${R}^{3}.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"All the statements are true.\"" 13194139534949 true] [17592186321918 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321919 13194139534949 true] [17592186321918 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321920 13194139534949 true] [17592186321918 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321921 13194139534949 true] [17592186321918 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321922 13194139534949 true] [17592186321918 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321923 13194139534949 true] [17592186321918 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534949 true] [17592186321918 1041 "selection" 13194139534949 true] [17592186321918 1104 #edb/ref 17592186321922 13194139534949 true] [17592186321918 1110 #uuid "cb98135f-6b79-511a-af69-fa33343b0a77" 13194139534949 true] [17592186321919 1034 "I and IV only" 13194139534949 true] [17592186321919 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534949 true] [17592186321919 1111 #uuid "6ba733d6-8ff5-5bdd-a892-a12b76600018" 13194139534949 true] [17592186321920 1034 "I and II only" 13194139534949 true] [17592186321920 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534949 true] [17592186321920 1111 #uuid "31dd66cc-3d3c-5437-94cb-7b5b526542e3" 13194139534949 true] [17592186321921 1034 "I, II, and III only" 13194139534949 true] [17592186321921 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534949 true] [17592186321921 1111 #uuid "56ca87e5-84e3-5805-ba33-48b02c054cbf" 13194139534949 true] [17592186321922 1034 "All the statements are true" 13194139534949 true] [17592186321922 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534949 true] [17592186321922 1111 #uuid "acb01be4-7e6b-517f-8270-d2bed7e9c03c" 13194139534949 true] [17592186321923 1034 "II only" 13194139